     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I happened to have the same question.<div><br></div><div>One option I am thinking about is to change the  content of &quot;Records per page&quot; into (50, 100, ALL). But I am not sure how to change the setting. </div><div><br></div><div>Also, adding a scroll bar is a great idea. Would someone else happen to know it?</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks!</div></div>"
