   "subject": "Re: Add a scroll bar in DataTable",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "The JSON object can be written as a list in R:\r<br>\r<br>renderDataTable(..., options = list(\r<br>  scrollY = &#39;200px&#39;,\r<br>  scrollCollapse = TRUE,\r<br>  paging = FALSE\r<br>))\r<br>\r<br>Regards,\r<br>Yihui\r<br>"
    ],
    [
     3,
